WEBVTT

1
00:01:02.025 --> 00:01:05.657
Almighty God, in my hour
of need, be with me.

2
00:01:06.736 --> 00:01:10.677
Let me never forget my sacred
and holy vows onto thee

3
00:01:11.053 --> 00:01:13.706
and I should not be
prey onto demons and

4
00:01:13.719 --> 00:01:16.382
devils, and all the dark
things of this world.

5
00:01:17.496 --> 00:01:20.470
Honour me with the armor
of thy righteousness.

6
00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:24.196
Give me the sword of truth,
that I shall confound mine enemies...

7
00:01:24.316 --> 00:01:28.743
And be onto thee... the true knight.

8
00:03:10.121 --> 00:03:12.388
They blockade the path!

9
00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:15.018
This way!

10
00:03:24.533 --> 00:03:25.549
Guard!

11
00:03:26.315 --> 00:03:27.715
Fall back!

12
00:03:28.722 --> 00:03:30.490
Coveeer!!

13
00:03:39.878 --> 00:03:43.169
- Jacob, we can stop this.
- Stop now, we lose more men.

14
00:03:43.429 --> 00:03:45.835
There is no stopping this Glenn

15
00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:49.398
- We can outflank them.
- There are women and children in it.

16
00:03:49.478 --> 00:03:51.376
- They won't be hurt.
- They will be hurt.

17
00:03:51.456 --> 00:03:53.131
We end this today!

18
00:03:55.355 --> 00:03:56.808
With me!!

19
00:03:57.869 --> 00:03:58.880
- Your highness.

20
00:03:59.304 --> 00:04:03.082
- With Allah's help we may still prevail.
- The time for false hope is over.

21
00:04:04.731 --> 00:04:07.824
There is one final request
I must beg of you, my friend.

22
00:04:13.000 --> 00:04:16.452
Haven't you had enough of this -
killing for hypocrite priests?

23
00:04:16.651 --> 00:04:20.442
- We do God's work.
- The blood we spill here is on our blades.

24
00:04:20.522 --> 00:04:22.708
Our souls, not God's!

25
00:04:30.181 --> 00:04:33.522
We don't have to do this anymore.
We can just go.

26
00:04:33.602 --> 00:04:34.962
- Go where?
- East.

27
00:04:35.243 --> 00:04:36.471
No one goes east.

28
00:04:39.652 --> 00:04:42.895
- Cannot be any worse than here.
- You doubt our cause?

29
00:04:44.142 --> 00:04:47.747
- You're not the man you once were.
- None of us are.

30
00:04:52.663 --> 00:04:54.960
Go there. Go east!

31
00:04:55.411 --> 00:04:58.974
You know, I swore an oath to your father.

32
00:04:59.174 --> 00:05:02.350
My father is dead, you are released
of your oath.

33
00:05:02.872 --> 00:05:04.875
I release you. Go!

34
00:05:12.028 --> 00:05:14.104
- Father.
- Papa!

35
00:05:23.028 --> 00:05:25.228
Hassan will escort you away from here.

36
00:05:25.648 --> 00:05:28.228
I will see you again... very soon.

37
00:05:28.930 --> 00:05:30.662
You have to be strong.

38
00:05:31.450 --> 00:05:34.077
You have to be strong.
For the children, for us.

39
00:05:34.676 --> 00:05:36.510
My love.

40
00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:04.159
God with us!!!

41
00:07:28.977 --> 00:07:30.347
Stop, this is finished.

42
00:08:27.328 --> 00:08:28.916
Leave.

43
00:09:14.705 --> 00:09:17.320
My days draw to an end, my son.

44
00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:21.368
- No, father!
- They do... child.

45
00:09:22.826 --> 00:09:24.760
That is the nature of life.

46
00:09:28.067 --> 00:09:30.432
All that is left for me...

47
00:09:31.083 --> 00:09:35.837
Is to ensure my kingdom
receives the leader it deserves.

48
00:09:36.672 --> 00:09:38.916
Which is why I have chosen you...

49
00:09:39.703 --> 00:09:41.293
To sucseed me.

50
00:09:41.804 --> 00:09:47.575
- Me? But... shing?
- Your brother is a great warrior.

51
00:09:49.789 --> 00:09:52.911
Now it's the time for peace.

52
00:09:54.049 --> 00:09:56.430
That is my request of you.

53
00:09:56.946 --> 00:09:59.468
Father, no one will follow me.

54
00:09:59.588 --> 00:10:00.661
They will...

55
00:10:01.359 --> 00:10:03.520
Because you will be king.

56
00:10:12.063 --> 00:10:14.361
Majesty, prince shing approaches the gates.

57
00:10:15.209 --> 00:10:17.479
Our time is less than we thought.

58
00:10:18.110 --> 00:10:20.107
Qiang long, the royal seal.

59
00:10:22.444 --> 00:10:24.152
Yes, your majesty.

60
00:10:30.916 --> 00:10:32.913
Qiang long will escort you...

61
00:10:33.668 --> 00:10:37.777
Ensure that you all safely reaches
the general sen ching wen.

62
00:10:40.730 --> 00:10:43.672
I will protect him with my life.

63
00:10:50.513 --> 00:10:53.891
I have made none of these
decisions lightly.

64
00:10:55.710 --> 00:10:59.173
Which is why... I have chosen you.

65
00:11:05.629 --> 00:11:06.862
Father.

66
00:11:11.668 --> 00:11:14.044
Out of necessity, lian.

67
00:11:15.555 --> 00:11:18.303
A king... tends more to his sons.

68
00:11:18.695 --> 00:11:22.753
But it does not mean... he has any
less love for his daughter.

69
00:11:25.557 --> 00:11:28.594
I trust you... with your brother's life.

70
00:11:29.555 --> 00:11:31.844
With the future of our kingdom.

71
00:11:35.252 --> 00:11:36.621
Go now.

72
00:11:52.118 --> 00:11:53.833
Majesty.

73
00:11:55.378 --> 00:11:58.630
- It's been a long time.
- Too long, my son.

74
00:11:59.057 --> 00:12:02.013
I came as soon as I heard
of your declining health.

75
00:12:02.093 --> 00:12:05.934
My health has always
been a concern of yours.

76
00:12:10.396 --> 00:12:13.387
I have other concerns, father.

77
00:12:14.681 --> 00:12:17.544
About... rumors I've heard.

78
00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:23.450
Rumors... are the distraction of
children and old women.

79
00:12:24.513 --> 00:12:27.871
Indeed. Unless they are true.

80
00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:34.262
And... what rumor carries...
Such weight, my son?

81
00:12:35.249 --> 00:12:38.761
Perhaps we should summon my baby brother
to discuss it?

82
00:12:41.455 --> 00:12:45.669
Unfortunately, your brother
is away from the palace.

83
00:12:46.832 --> 00:12:51.324
I fear your ill health is clouding
your judgment, father.

84
00:12:52.336 --> 00:12:55.394
The throne is my birthright!!

85
00:12:56.231 --> 00:12:58.974
I earned it, fighting your wars!

86
00:12:59.697 --> 00:13:03.632
Without you... there would be no kingdom...

87
00:13:04.012 --> 00:13:05.483
But everything!

88
00:13:07.887 --> 00:13:10.113
I've given everything for you.

89
00:13:11.144 --> 00:13:13.379
I know... my son.

90
00:13:14.524 --> 00:13:15.576
But please...

91
00:13:17.043 --> 00:13:19.828
It is in the best
interests of the people.

92
00:13:19.948 --> 00:13:24.067
- What... do you know about the people?!
- Prince shing!

93
00:13:25.885 --> 00:13:29.503
My son means me... no harm.

94
00:13:40.298 --> 00:13:42.675
My father must trust you very much.

95
00:13:45.520 --> 00:13:51.163
You have family? A wife? Children?

96
00:13:53.473 --> 00:13:58.968
Resist me and I will see that your children
are nailed to the walls of your home...

97
00:13:59.228 --> 00:14:02.300
- ...one piece at a time.
- Shing!

98
00:14:03.114 --> 00:14:08.271
That your wife spends the rest of her life
pleasuring my guards.

99
00:14:09.475 --> 00:14:12.637
Die for a king whose time has passed...

100
00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.358
Or choose to serve a new one.

101
00:14:21.544 --> 00:14:25.852
- Leave us.
- Out! All of you.

102
00:14:42.614 --> 00:14:44.947
Remember this blade, father?

103
00:14:45.805 --> 00:14:49.525
Your mother... once saved my life with it.

104
00:14:50.361 --> 00:14:55.948
When I was old enough... she gave it to me.

105
00:14:56.814 --> 00:14:59.177
And told me I would be king.

106
00:14:59.372 --> 00:15:01.888
But you are not the child she loved.

107
00:15:08.154 --> 00:15:10.021
Where is the seal?

108
00:15:17.060 --> 00:15:20.308
Where. Is. The. Seal?

109
00:16:00.019 --> 00:16:03.147
Heaven... forgive him.

110
00:16:03.500 --> 00:16:08.236
Heaven is closed to me... because of
all the things I've done for you.

111
00:16:22.654 --> 00:16:25.755
The king... is dead.

112
00:16:26.995 --> 00:16:30.052
Murdered. By prince qiang.

113
00:16:31.065 --> 00:16:34.355
He stole the royal seal.
Bring it to me.

114
00:16:41.240 --> 00:16:42.271
Follow me.

115
00:16:44.554 --> 00:16:47.577
Keep your men under control.

116
00:16:48.044 --> 00:16:49.506
Summon general gao.

117
00:16:50.943 --> 00:16:51.823
Now.

118
00:16:52.369 --> 00:16:54.013
Or should I send for your family?

119
00:17:00.196 --> 00:17:01.768
The horse!

120
00:17:20.696 --> 00:17:22.033
Stop them!

121
00:17:31.590 --> 00:17:32.872
Go!

122
00:18:55.140 --> 00:18:57.098
Maybe we should just keep going?

123
00:18:57.376 --> 00:19:01.335
And how far will we get? We have no horse.
We need help.

124
00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:12.953
- You stay here.
- But lian, I should go!

125
00:19:13.235 --> 00:19:17.515
Father chose you, because he knows
you are strong.

126
00:19:20.727 --> 00:19:24.634
Whatever happens, you keep going.
You reach the generals.

127
00:19:24.981 --> 00:19:26.568
And you will be king.

128
00:19:35.272 --> 00:19:36.527
Be careful.

129
00:20:32.536 --> 00:20:33.504
Here.

130
00:20:36.171 --> 00:20:37.723
No money, no food.

131
00:20:44.235 --> 00:20:48.301
When you first came in,
I thought you might be the white ghost.

132
00:20:50.232 --> 00:20:51.876
I guess I was wrong.

133
00:20:58.443 --> 00:20:59.917
Is that the princess?

134
00:21:04.713 --> 00:21:06.170
I seek an escort for the road.

135
00:21:13.028 --> 00:21:14.010
I can pay.

136
00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:17.718
What use is coin to the dead?
The black guards are hunting you.

137
00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:22.019
Look who I found skulking outside!

138
00:21:26.862 --> 00:21:29.031
I'm sorry, I did not see them.

139
00:21:33.135 --> 00:21:36.731
- My father will hear of this.
- So the dead have ears.

140
00:21:37.799 --> 00:21:41.452
No, my father is not dead.
It's not true!

141
00:21:41.572 --> 00:21:45.418
Oh, you know it is.
After all it was you who murdered him.

142
00:21:46.616 --> 00:21:50.787
- Or was it you, princess?
- Shing.

143
00:21:52.271 --> 00:21:55.006
The seal, where is it?

144
00:21:59.551 --> 00:22:00.370
You mind?

145
00:22:09.957 --> 00:22:11.336
Hold them.

146
00:22:13.295 --> 00:22:15.641
No! Stop it.

147
00:22:19.428 --> 00:22:20.718
Give it back to me!

148
00:22:22.171 --> 00:22:25.553
- The seal is mine!
- Cut these throats.

149
00:22:37.764 --> 00:22:40.211
The sword... is mine.

150
00:22:41.783 --> 00:22:43.471
It belongs to me.

151
00:22:45.513 --> 00:22:47.188
I'd like it back.

152
00:22:47.388 --> 00:22:48.862
Then come.

153
00:22:51.789 --> 00:22:53.579
Take it.

154
00:23:04.509 --> 00:23:06.004
Opium.

155
00:23:07.049 --> 00:23:11.184
Your kind are such fools.
Clean him up.

156
00:23:20.125 --> 00:23:21.238
Kill him.

157
00:24:28.297 --> 00:24:29.918
- Lian.
- Qiang!

158
00:24:40.769 --> 00:24:43.980
Either way, the boy dies.

159
00:24:45.470 --> 00:24:51.300
- Kill him then, I just want my sword back.
- If I give it to you, then will you leave?

160
00:25:20.474 --> 00:25:22.132
You have to help us.

161
00:25:23.081 --> 00:25:24.652
Good luck, princess.

162
00:25:45.998 --> 00:25:47.198
Wait!

163
00:26:00.180 --> 00:26:01.761
Much obliged.

164
00:26:02.812 --> 00:26:05.152
Wait. Qiang, come.

165
00:26:06.094 --> 00:26:10.130
Please! Help us. We must
get to shing yuing.

166
00:26:10.641 --> 00:26:13.601
If your reward is what
you seek, we have gold.

167
00:26:15.153 --> 00:26:19.700
My brother is the kingdom's only hope.
If you don't help us, we will be killed.

168
00:26:20.309 --> 00:26:23.561
Come. You will be if you stay here.

169
00:28:15.739 --> 00:28:19.638
Do what you must,
but there are riders down below.

170
00:28:21.171 --> 00:28:24.397
- How many?
- Wake the boy. Quietly.

171
00:28:27.268 --> 00:28:29.657
Shh. We have to hide.

172
00:29:08.265 --> 00:29:09.755
Keep looking!

173
00:29:21.130 --> 00:29:22.376
Why did you come back?

174
00:29:24.220 --> 00:29:25.772
You had your sword.

175
00:29:29.088 --> 00:29:30.374
You promised gold.

176
00:29:37.107 --> 00:29:39.336
And I was having that way, anyway.

177
00:29:46.139 --> 00:29:48.080
What brings you to our lands?

178
00:29:58.928 --> 00:30:02.568
I know. But it's all we have.

179
00:30:24.494 --> 00:30:25.554
Let's stop.

180
00:30:29.549 --> 00:30:30.583
Wait here.

181
00:30:46.923 --> 00:30:48.630
I said, wait.

182
00:31:02.195 --> 00:31:03.547
This is our fault.

183
00:31:08.136 --> 00:31:10.601
- They need help.
- We need to go, come on.

184
00:31:11.537 --> 00:31:13.180
You can't just go!

185
00:31:14.407 --> 00:31:15.944
Wait!

186
00:32:10.967 --> 00:32:12.529
How is that possible?

187
00:32:26.939 --> 00:32:29.864
- Let me go!
- Come on!

188
00:32:37.286 --> 00:32:38.497
You're welcome.

189
00:32:39.974 --> 00:32:41.414
It's great.

190
00:32:47.903 --> 00:32:49.317
I'm only trying to help.

191
00:32:50.371 --> 00:32:51.956
All right?

192
00:32:53.693 --> 00:32:56.019
- I'm lian.
- I'm qiang.

193
00:32:57.241 --> 00:32:58.130
And you?

194
00:33:01.374 --> 00:33:02.800
Xaoi.

195
00:33:03.855 --> 00:33:05.339
Beautiflu name.

196
00:33:07.746 --> 00:33:09.769
We can't just abandon her.

197
00:33:11.304 --> 00:33:14.751
It's one more mouth to feed,
and one more body to hide.

198
00:33:18.200 --> 00:33:20.591
They seek three, not four.

199
00:33:25.804 --> 00:33:27.373
All right.

200
00:33:31.855 --> 00:33:34.479
That shot.
How did you make it?

201
00:33:35.753 --> 00:33:37.126
Practice.

202
00:33:37.690 --> 00:33:40.238
We go off the map, get through the woods.

203
00:33:40.707 --> 00:33:44.133
Hopefully we won't see any
black guards until ching shao.

204
00:33:56.784 --> 00:33:59.849
Your majesty, general gao.

205
00:34:01.439 --> 00:34:01.535
- Lord shing.
- Majesty.

206
00:34:01.615 --> 00:34:04.317
- Lord shing.
- Majesty.

207
00:34:07.125 --> 00:34:10.828
How many of your fellow generals
will offer support to the boy?

208
00:34:11.966 --> 00:34:16.738
- Once the council has officiated over the
appropriate ceremony... - Yes...

209
00:34:16.932 --> 00:34:21.427
Can't be no ceremonies without the seal.

210
00:34:22.989 --> 00:34:28.706
But... if he... has the seal,
there's nothing to be done.

211
00:34:36.904 --> 00:34:38.676
He murdered my father.

212
00:34:39.967 --> 00:34:42.146
Stole the seal.

213
00:34:44.172 --> 00:34:45.965
If that's the case...

214
00:34:46.681 --> 00:34:49.454
He will be punished. Accordingly.

215
00:34:50.084 --> 00:34:52.467
It's inexcusable.

216
00:34:53.112 --> 00:34:55.794
Even from a prince.

217
00:35:07.122 --> 00:35:08.625
Forgive me, general.

218
00:35:11.984 --> 00:35:15.808
My father's murder has
left me overemotional.

219
00:35:24.204 --> 00:35:26.280
They will be heading to shing yuing.

220
00:35:27.085 --> 00:35:28.967
Make sure they never get there.

221
00:35:33.503 --> 00:35:35.351
I'm sorry, for what shing's men did.

222
00:35:36.734 --> 00:35:38.403
He murdered my father, too.

223
00:35:38.483 --> 00:35:41.478
For what, a few coins and a rusty plough?

224
00:35:41.695 --> 00:35:43.287
Does it matter what it was for?

225
00:35:43.739 --> 00:35:46.970
I want to make things better,
for people like you!

226
00:35:47.602 --> 00:35:52.274
Do you think it makes a difference for
people like me - who sits on the throne?

227
00:35:52.354 --> 00:35:55.704
It should. And we change things.

228
00:35:57.151 --> 00:35:58.609
You don't believe me?

229
00:35:59.824 --> 00:36:05.170
I believe you're just a boy,
and shing yuing is still faaar away.

230
00:36:05.353 --> 00:36:08.402
And yet, it's closer than yesterday.

231
00:36:20.295 --> 00:36:21.907
We'll make camp here.

232
00:36:56.726 --> 00:36:58.407
I needed that.

233
00:36:59.051 --> 00:37:02.280
Tear of the poppy. Dull the man's senses.

234
00:37:04.849 --> 00:37:07.147
Some things are better dulled.

235
00:37:08.967 --> 00:37:11.459
Our lives and the future of our kingdom...

236
00:37:13.227 --> 00:37:15.278
Depending upon your wits.

237
00:37:16.907 --> 00:37:18.622
Your kingdom.

238
00:37:24.023 --> 00:37:25.863
You're far from home.

239
00:37:27.028 --> 00:37:30.731
Are you running? Or searching?

240
00:37:31.167 --> 00:37:32.667
Both.

241
00:37:36.826 --> 00:37:38.813
Your people...

242
00:37:40.051 --> 00:37:43.846
- ...do they believe in hell?
- We believe in diyu.

243
00:37:45.092 --> 00:37:47.084
The realm of the dead.

244
00:37:48.086 --> 00:37:51.084
One is assigned to one of 18 levels.

245
00:37:51.164 --> 00:37:54.632
A place of heart God Jiao.
The lake of blood.

246
00:37:57.878 --> 00:37:59.635
The punishment fits the crime.

247
00:38:01.488 --> 00:38:03.155
What was yours?

248
00:38:05.266 --> 00:38:07.722
Ohh... there've been many.

249
00:38:11.486 --> 00:38:13.969
We all have our weights to bear.

250
00:38:17.541 --> 00:38:22.803
No doubt, the life of a princess...
Is a heavy burden.

251
00:38:22.915 --> 00:38:26.005
Do you know what it's like - being a woman
in this world?

252
00:38:26.205 --> 00:38:30.044
Do you think watching men destroy
everything you care about bears no weight?

253
00:38:30.710 --> 00:38:32.893
And for what? Pride?

254
00:38:34.507 --> 00:38:35.764
Greed?

255
00:38:36.714 --> 00:38:39.887
You warriors march off
and forge new worlds.

256
00:38:40.147 --> 00:38:42.755
We have to stay behind,
to raise the children.

257
00:38:44.618 --> 00:38:47.278
We have to explain why their
fathers don't return.

258
00:38:48.700 --> 00:38:52.095
And we have to fix the
broken creatures that do.

259
00:38:56.714 --> 00:38:59.114
Do not judge my life.

260
00:38:59.374 --> 00:39:01.177
When you know nothing
about being a woman.

261
00:39:01.190 --> 00:39:03.003
I'm sorry.

262
00:39:03.775 --> 00:39:06.849
A princess... is a woman, too.

263
00:39:09.698 --> 00:39:12.703
I am, what you wanted of me.

264
00:39:15.349 --> 00:39:18.376
I did what you needed, but couldn't.

265
00:39:22.294 --> 00:39:25.099
I will have what is mine.

266
00:39:36.657 --> 00:39:37.731
Wake up.

267
00:39:44.742 --> 00:39:46.893
I want to fire arrows like you.

268
00:39:54.680 --> 00:39:55.669
Teach me.

269
00:40:12.174 --> 00:40:13.263
Teach me!

270
00:40:17.929 --> 00:40:19.891
I thought white devils didn't bathe.

271
00:40:22.038 --> 00:40:25.026
A man picks up bad habits
when he is away from home.

272
00:40:26.997 --> 00:40:30.726
You've been in many battles?
I wish to become a great warrior, too.

273
00:40:31.409 --> 00:40:34.643
My father wanted me to learn from books,
not have to fight.

274
00:40:36.094 --> 00:40:37.633
Teach me!

275
00:40:38.238 --> 00:40:40.368
- Why?
- My father...

276
00:40:42.323 --> 00:40:43.927
Shing must pay.

277
00:40:46.667 --> 00:40:47.715
Please.

278
00:40:49.574 --> 00:40:50.498
Teach me.

279
00:40:53.568 --> 00:40:55.804
Battle is both craft and art.

280
00:40:57.033 --> 00:40:59.132
First you must learn to craft.

281
00:41:00.172 --> 00:41:06.040
Then you push past it, until action and
reaction become instinct. A part of you.

282
00:41:07.922 --> 00:41:11.280
The man who taught you,
was he a great warrior?

283
00:41:27.731 --> 00:41:30.914
Use your back, allright?
Not your shoulders.

284
00:41:32.413 --> 00:41:33.411
Release.

285
00:41:49.606 --> 00:41:50.577
Fire.

286
00:42:04.000 --> 00:42:04.786
Fire!

287
00:42:11.306 --> 00:42:12.224
I'm sorry!

288
00:42:14.107 --> 00:42:14.893
Better.

289
00:42:18.256 --> 00:42:23.219
- You're good with my brother.
- The boy has a good heart and mind.

290
00:42:24.671 --> 00:42:26.381
Like his sister.

291
00:42:29.318 --> 00:42:32.536
If we'd gone east, we'd already
been nearing shing yuing.

292
00:42:32.690 --> 00:42:35.050
Where do you think the most of black guard
are concentrated?

293
00:42:35.657 --> 00:42:38.486
Once we get past ching shao,
there is less chance that they follow.

294
00:42:38.981 --> 00:42:41.803
They follow who ever
my brother instructs.

295
00:42:42.118 --> 00:42:44.051
In the silver mountains
there said to be

296
00:42:44.064 --> 00:42:46.008
bandits who despise your
brother and his men.

297
00:42:46.644 --> 00:42:50.771
You mean the white ghost.
Wouldn't he despise us equally?

298
00:43:00.127 --> 00:43:01.856
Quiet, stay low.

299
00:43:11.361 --> 00:43:14.034
We should move on, quickly,
mount off.

300
00:43:20.016 --> 00:43:21.495
- Thank you.

301
00:43:22.862 --> 00:43:24.296
You're welcome.

302
00:43:41.969 --> 00:43:43.622
Ching shao.

303
00:43:46.008 --> 00:43:48.217
Everyone will be looking for you.

304
00:43:49.645 --> 00:43:51.722
We need to find a way in.

305
00:44:11.647 --> 00:44:14.056
- Greetings.
- Greetings.

306
00:44:16.093 --> 00:44:20.467
I'm travelling with my mistress and her
servant boy, searching for new company.

307
00:44:22.199 --> 00:44:27.165
You will find us extremely hospitable,
for the right price.

308
00:44:32.496 --> 00:44:35.601
You and your lady are welcome to join us.

309
00:44:39.319 --> 00:44:41.879
She's shy, she enjoys her privacy.

310
00:44:42.217 --> 00:44:45.602
She will enjoy it so much more
in a city full of strangers.

311
00:44:58.688 --> 00:45:00.538
You gave her your gold.

312
00:45:03.314 --> 00:45:07.078
I'll see you are properly rewarded
when we reach shing yuing.

313
00:45:26.958 --> 00:45:28.674
Stay calm.

314
00:45:34.894 --> 00:45:36.401
Dismount slowly.

315
00:45:44.808 --> 00:45:47.203
- Out of the cart!
- What seems to be the problem?

316
00:45:47.283 --> 00:45:49.783
We are searching for the
prince and princess.

317
00:45:50.271 --> 00:45:52.569
You'll find nothing of interest here.

318
00:45:57.118 --> 00:45:58.991
Let them through!

319
00:46:05.042 --> 00:46:07.356
Come on, let's go.

320
00:46:26.785 --> 00:46:28.472
You did well.

321
00:46:48.492 --> 00:46:50.260
You should stay with us.

322
00:46:50.273 --> 00:46:52.051
I think my mistress would
prefer to keep travelling.

323
00:46:52.151 --> 00:46:54.995
You're exhausted, and
think of the children.

324
00:46:55.611 --> 00:47:00.089
I have private rooms, your mistress
will appreciate the privacy.

325
00:47:41.057 --> 00:47:42.690
Waht are you looking at?

326
00:47:56.747 --> 00:47:58.638
You are hungrier than you appeared.

327
00:48:00.220 --> 00:48:04.672
Take my guests to clean up.
They must be tired.

328
00:48:11.617 --> 00:48:12.986
Stay.

329
00:48:14.427 --> 00:48:17.213
I have something that may interest you.

330
00:48:27.301 --> 00:48:29.420
Make sure you are fit to travel.

331
00:48:32.610 --> 00:48:34.823
Thank you for your hospitality.

332
00:48:47.815 --> 00:48:50.008
It's all to your health.

333
00:48:58.565 --> 00:48:59.916
This way.

334
00:49:10.219 --> 00:49:12.748
- Are you all right?
- Of course I am.

335
00:49:13.544 --> 00:49:16.849
- He served us well.
- Did anyone say he hasn't?

336
00:49:18.474 --> 00:49:19.932
Now go and get cleaned up.

337
00:49:21.249 --> 00:49:23.589
I want to be ready to leave
first thing tomorrow.

338
00:49:23.665 --> 00:49:26.469
- It's still early.
- Just do as I say, xiaoli.

339
00:49:34.727 --> 00:49:39.402
If you'll excuse me, I have some business
to attend to.

340
00:49:44.007 --> 00:49:45.758
What did you give me?

341
00:49:50.541 --> 00:49:51.919
Help the man!

342
00:49:53.439 --> 00:49:55.957
Apparently he can't handle his drink.

343
00:51:22.342 --> 00:51:24.835
It's not you they want!
They're worth more

344
00:51:24.848 --> 00:51:27.352
money than you've ever seen!
Your share alone!

345
00:51:28.684 --> 00:51:30.372
I already have a mistress.

346
00:51:32.653 --> 00:51:36.349
- Come on, you have to go. Come on, now!
- What happened?

347
00:51:36.754 --> 00:51:39.479
Let's go! We've been betrayed.

348
00:51:41.267 --> 00:51:44.874
- Hurry, this way.
- Wait, our horses!

349
00:51:44.974 --> 00:51:48.261
You'll never pass the city gates.
Go to the river and find a boat.

350
00:51:48.341 --> 00:51:51.006
Head downstream, wait for me
at the silver Mountain.

351
00:51:51.086 --> 00:51:54.521
- There are bandits!
- I know, that's where I was going.

352
00:51:54.677 --> 00:51:56.714
- And you?
- I'll meet you there.

353
00:51:57.638 --> 00:52:00.927
If I don't arrive, shing yuing
is a day beyond the Mountain.

354
00:52:01.805 --> 00:52:03.859
I don't even know your name.

355
00:52:03.860 --> 00:52:06.576
Please lian, go. Go now!

356
00:52:07.824 --> 00:52:09.223
Allright, just go.

357
00:52:19.182 --> 00:52:20.843
Untie them all.

358
00:52:44.361 --> 00:52:45.670
Go search the building!

359
00:53:05.942 --> 00:53:07.295
Don't kill him yet!

360
00:53:12.809 --> 00:53:15.362
Where are they? Speak quickly.

361
00:53:20.385 --> 00:53:22.811
Tell me now, or I kill you.

362
00:53:24.754 --> 00:53:26.780
General, prince qiang and
princess lian are on

363
00:53:26.793 --> 00:53:28.830
the river headed toward
the silver m ountains.

364
00:53:29.500 --> 00:53:30.675
Go after them.

365
00:56:00.911 --> 00:56:02.546
Get to the shore!

366
00:56:07.249 --> 00:56:08.726
Run!

367
00:57:28.393 --> 00:57:31.761
Let me go! Let go!

368
00:59:23.071 --> 00:59:24.229
Open your mouth.

369
01:00:16.414 --> 01:00:18.667
It was my choice, I would have let you rot.

370
01:00:25.984 --> 01:00:28.049
- My companions?
- Safe!

371
01:00:30.150 --> 01:00:34.012
The black guards are as thick as flies
on a farting goats arse because of you.

372
01:00:34.462 --> 01:00:36.198
You brought them here.

373
01:00:39.958 --> 01:00:43.982
- How did you find me, lad?
- Nobody goes east.

374
01:00:46.120 --> 01:00:47.234
Remember?

375
01:00:52.154 --> 01:00:55.565
There is few of our
kind beyond Baghdad.

376
01:01:04.044 --> 01:01:06.844
- We need to talk.
- We have nothing to say.

377
01:01:06.900 --> 01:01:07.900
 - Please.

378
01:01:09.542 --> 01:01:13.192
I should have left you in the woods.
For crow meat

379
01:01:18.413 --> 01:01:19.935
But you didn't.

380
01:01:25.978 --> 01:01:28.276
As soon as you can move, you leave.

381
01:01:30.362 --> 01:01:34.163
Glenn! Glenn, please!

382
01:01:49.628 --> 01:01:53.463
- Please. He lives?
- For now.

383
01:01:53.658 --> 01:01:56.587
You're the outlaw they
call the white ghost?

384
01:01:55.900 --> 01:01:58.139
I am the white ghost.

385
01:01:58.506 --> 01:02:03.439
But no one calls me outlaw, child.
Not to my face!

386
01:02:04.800 --> 01:02:07.940
- Your friend sent us here.
- My friend?

387
01:02:08.616 --> 01:02:10.860
And you expect that to count in your favor?

388
01:02:11.669 --> 01:02:13.285
You saved our lives.

389
01:02:13.298 --> 01:02:14.925
Well, killing black guards,
that was no hardship.

390
01:02:15.524 --> 01:02:17.192
Your lives have value.

391
01:02:18.640 --> 01:02:19.993
Yes, my love.

392
01:02:20.716 --> 01:02:22.949
Shing will pay handsomely
for your return.

393
01:02:22.962 --> 01:02:25.205
Or he might just kill you.
Outlaw!

394
01:02:26.620 --> 01:02:29.872
If we escape my brother,
I will be the king.

395
01:02:31.466 --> 01:02:34.911
- How old are you? 10?
- 14!

396
01:02:36.823 --> 01:02:39.773
- And I should help you, because?
- I will give you a reward!

397
01:02:40.176 --> 01:02:42.263
And you may come down from
this Mountain! A free man.

398
01:02:42.276 --> 01:02:44.374
Now, I do not know.

399
01:02:44.983 --> 01:02:47.427
In my experience those who
climb to the top only

400
01:02:47.440 --> 01:02:49.895
ever remember they got
there by their own effort.

401
01:02:50.135 --> 01:02:51.975
I won't forget!

402
01:02:51.988 --> 01:02:53.838
Maybe you will, maybe you won't.
I need time to think.

403
01:02:54.658 --> 01:02:57.751
You are lucky my wife likes you.
Where is my wine?!

404
01:03:01.067 --> 01:03:03.506
Free them, they got nowhere to run.

405
01:03:22.313 --> 01:03:24.146
You were his friend.

406
01:03:27.423 --> 01:03:29.555
We fought alongside one another.

407
01:03:30.265 --> 01:03:32.792
- He belives he's damned.
- He's right.

408
01:03:33.899 --> 01:03:36.378
We were, all of us - killers.

409
01:03:38.689 --> 01:03:40.379
But he became...

410
01:03:42.138 --> 01:03:43.764
More than that.

411
01:03:45.860 --> 01:03:49.359
- That what warriors do!
- Some get a taste for blood.

412
01:03:51.269 --> 01:03:53.126
He is not one of them.

413
01:03:53.880 --> 01:03:58.175
There was a time I wanted that to be true,
as much as you do now.

414
01:04:01.635 --> 01:04:03.766
At least he still sees hope in others.

415
01:04:04.980 --> 01:04:09.082
Puts his sword at the service of that,
rather than his own game.

416
01:04:34.730 --> 01:04:36.603
Your majesty, we have news!

417
01:04:42.222 --> 01:04:43.680
Saddle the horses.

418
01:05:07.588 --> 01:05:09.008
Jacob...

419
01:05:10.872 --> 01:05:15.946
- My name is Jacob.
- Nice to meet you, Jacob.

420
01:05:18.933 --> 01:05:22.633
- I am sorry.
- For what?

421
01:05:25.095 --> 01:05:28.426
We'd never have come this far without you.

422
01:05:35.241 --> 01:05:38.291
You... don't have to do that.

423
01:05:39.260 --> 01:05:42.117
I know. I want to.

424
01:05:43.383 --> 01:05:47.474
There's not much else to do here,
except watch xaoi eat.

425
01:05:54.058 --> 01:05:56.017
She lives because of you.

426
01:05:57.246 --> 01:05:58.133
As do we.

427
01:06:01.455 --> 01:06:04.039
Maybe you've repaid your debt.

428
01:06:06.545 --> 01:06:09.007
Rest, for now.

429
01:06:14.006 --> 01:06:16.406
Please, help me.

430
01:06:17.608 --> 01:06:19.457
I must see him.

431
01:06:50.619 --> 01:06:51.513
What?

432
01:06:53.063 --> 01:06:55.645
Oh man, don't you ever stop?

433
01:07:17.807 --> 01:07:22.513
Here, fucking opium.
It keeps the ghosts away, huh?

434
01:07:23.511 --> 01:07:25.016
This is my medicine.

435
01:07:28.215 --> 01:07:29.863
What you saw that day...

436
01:07:30.331 --> 01:07:33.868
If it's forgiveness that brought you here,
you've come a long way for nothing.

437
01:07:34.637 --> 01:07:37.792
Perhaps you've come to tell me
it was some terrible mistake?

438
01:07:38.450 --> 01:07:42.531
- That you didn't kill them? Huh?
- I can't tell you that.

439
01:07:43.388 --> 01:07:46.330
But they did not die by
my sword, I promise.

440
01:07:47.565 --> 01:07:49.589
Riddles give me headaches.

441
01:07:54.649 --> 01:07:57.792
The children were killed
by their own mothers.

442
01:08:03.975 --> 01:08:06.078
The women died by their own hands.

443
01:08:19.900 --> 01:08:22.859
Because they fear of what you have become.

444
01:08:23.662 --> 01:08:24.667
Yes.

445
01:08:26.741 --> 01:08:28.000
What is it?

446
01:08:29.246 --> 01:08:32.769
You think if you save this boy,
God will forgive you?

447
01:08:34.949 --> 01:08:38.971
Men can not know God's will,
and when they pretend to...

448
01:08:39.521 --> 01:08:43.478
- ...it ends in blood.
- That I'll drink to.

449
01:09:00.822 --> 01:09:04.555
So what happened to you?
The white ghost, bandits?

450
01:09:05.370 --> 01:09:10.115
I tried my hand as a merchant.
But the black guards took all I had.

451
01:09:12.358 --> 01:09:17.210
My wife - she's good
with a knife, aint't it?

452
01:09:18.265 --> 01:09:24.295
But in one time... she had the most...
Beautiful... singing voice.

453
01:09:25.222 --> 01:09:27.296
But the... guards...

454
01:09:28.899 --> 01:09:31.371
Cut out her tongue!!

455
01:09:32.191 --> 01:09:36.297
Blinded my right eye.
But I still have her.

456
01:09:37.371 --> 01:09:39.546
Which is all that really matters.

457
01:09:40.529 --> 01:09:44.303
If shing becomes king, this land will burn.

458
01:09:44.973 --> 01:09:49.229
All lands burn, Jacob. You know that.

459
01:09:49.779 --> 01:09:51.204
Better than anyone.

460
01:09:53.552 --> 01:09:55.330
I have to take a piss.

461
01:10:28.204 --> 01:10:29.874
You should be resting.

462
01:10:31.081 --> 01:10:34.049
I'm younger and healthier than you.

463
01:10:44.128 --> 01:10:46.037
I made a promise to my father.

464
01:10:47.566 --> 01:10:49.139
I swore to him...

465
01:10:51.064 --> 01:10:53.087
I'd protect qiang with my life.

466
01:11:00.374 --> 01:11:01.726
But you...

467
01:11:03.476 --> 01:11:04.598
Why?

468
01:11:10.441 --> 01:11:13.562
I once looked for God
in all of the wrong places.

469
01:11:16.817 --> 01:11:19.305
But you... your brother...

470
01:11:21.463 --> 01:11:23.381
It started to make sense again.

471
01:11:28.733 --> 01:11:30.826
My father would have liked you.

472
01:11:33.100 --> 01:11:38.446
Ohhh, I don't know. I think your father
would have taken my head.

473
01:11:42.766 --> 01:11:44.446
And rightly so.

474
01:11:47.742 --> 01:11:50.023
Perhaps to the man we first met.

475
01:11:51.853 --> 01:11:55.905
But you... he would have loved.

476
01:11:58.389 --> 01:12:00.105
Lian, I...

477
01:12:27.133 --> 01:12:28.967
He's been out there for hours.

478
01:12:29.462 --> 01:12:32.219
With the right people by his side
he will hold the peace.

479
01:12:33.902 --> 01:12:38.303
You sound like one of those priests
that blessed us as we marched off to war.

480
01:12:39.964 --> 01:12:41.504
The ghosts...

481
01:12:42.298 --> 01:12:45.715
- ...you really see them, too?
- Only when I let my guard down.

482
01:12:46.540 --> 01:12:48.540
And what do they ask of you?

483
01:12:51.512 --> 01:12:55.289
- Mine don't talk.
- They don't need to.

484
01:12:56.939 --> 01:13:00.053
And if they did?
What would the dead whisper?

485
01:13:00.733 --> 01:13:02.536
What is ought, must be paid.

486
01:13:06.743 --> 01:13:09.218
It's not for us to decide when, though.

487
01:13:11.729 --> 01:13:14.391
To the damned, each and every one of us.

488
01:13:16.866 --> 01:13:18.722
You are not hard enough on him.

489
01:13:19.385 --> 01:13:22.618
- Glenn, with your help...
- No!

490
01:13:24.721 --> 01:13:26.314
I told you before!

491
01:13:26.985 --> 01:13:29.353
I'm done fighting other men's causes.

492
01:13:30.338 --> 01:13:32.139
Ah, you could have
handed him over to shing.

493
01:13:32.152 --> 01:13:33.963
I'm a simple man.

494
01:13:34.413 --> 01:13:37.438
Easily bedazzled by swift-talking
young princess.

495
01:13:37.753 --> 01:13:41.839
You are many things, none of them simple.

496
01:14:07.533 --> 01:14:09.784
They black guards have
reached the riverbank.

497
01:14:11.685 --> 01:14:15.510
We have no choice now.
Make what preparations you can!

498
01:14:17.035 --> 01:14:18.035
Thats it!

499
01:14:20.060 --> 01:14:21.560
Make sure to seal them tight!

500
01:14:33.850 --> 01:14:34.350
What?

501
01:14:34.375 --> 01:14:36.375
How do you move this?

502
01:14:36.461 --> 01:14:39.041
No more that four bombs in each bag.

503
01:14:40.824 --> 01:14:42.582
I chose this place for a reason.

504
01:14:42.790 --> 01:14:45.516
We beat them down below,
take as many as we can.

505
01:14:45.596 --> 01:14:48.019
- Bring confusion.
- Fall back to the caves?

506
01:14:49.242 --> 01:14:52.357
- No, you stay here.
- But they're here for me.

507
01:14:54.036 --> 01:14:58.261
And if you die on the Mountain, you will
never be the leader your father wanted.

508
01:15:05.721 --> 01:15:07.278
Be careful.

509
01:15:55.707 --> 01:16:01.753
Shields!! Shields up!! Shields!!!

510
01:16:02.310 --> 01:16:06.719
Return fire! Return fire now!!!

511
01:16:19.766 --> 01:16:21.109
Fall back!!

512
01:17:37.350 --> 01:17:39.225
Get back to the cave, now!!

513
01:17:47.437 --> 01:17:49.807
Back to the cave, we'll finish them there!

514
01:17:59.356 --> 01:18:01.053
Let's go!!

515
01:18:09.962 --> 01:18:11.372
Get your sister and xiaoli
back to the inner cave.

516
01:18:11.385 --> 01:18:12.805
I should stay!

517
01:18:12.885 --> 01:18:14.861
- You've got nothing more
to prove, all right? Men

518
01:18:14.874 --> 01:18:16.860
have died for you, don't
let that be in vain.

519
01:18:17.227 --> 01:18:19.578
Go! Go now!

520
01:19:06.320 --> 01:19:08.353
Mei!! Now!!

521
01:19:11.370 --> 01:19:14.122
The black guards!!

522
01:19:20.822 --> 01:19:24.309
Go!! Go, Mei, go!!

523
01:20:22.390 --> 01:20:27.686
Go... get the boy... now!

524
01:20:43.902 --> 01:20:47.295
You want my blood?
You want my blood?!

525
01:21:07.593 --> 01:21:09.949
- The others?
- Oh, it's just Glenn. We have

526
01:21:09.962 --> 01:21:12.329
to leave, before more
black guards arrive.

527
01:22:51.192 --> 01:22:53.068
I see you...

528
01:22:55.738 --> 01:22:57.442
Woman...

529
01:23:01.380 --> 01:23:03.078
I see you...

530
01:23:27.383 --> 01:23:30.263
Qiang lian and the white monkey.

531
01:23:31.886 --> 01:23:33.372
Did you help them?

532
01:23:35.109 --> 01:23:37.098
Or was it this one?

533
01:23:46.476 --> 01:23:49.915
No. I think this one is the white ghost.

534
01:23:53.706 --> 01:23:57.316
- Why?
- Because...

535
01:23:58.762 --> 01:24:00.593
The boy isn't like us.

536
01:24:02.584 --> 01:24:04.528
And what are we like?

537
01:24:08.495 --> 01:24:10.893
The world will be better without us.

538
01:24:15.580 --> 01:24:18.426
And you... little brother.

539
01:24:20.207 --> 01:24:23.714
Do you really think bandits and barbarians
can win you the throne?

540
01:24:23.794 --> 01:24:26.463
Our father would hate what you have become.

541
01:24:33.057 --> 01:24:35.057
Then it's probably a good
thing you killed him.

542
01:25:03.989 --> 01:25:06.760
You've spilled a lot of blood today.

543
01:25:10.525 --> 01:25:13.037
Let's see how much you have left.

544
01:26:44.472 --> 01:26:47.605
The next man who raises his bow, dies!

545
01:27:06.995 --> 01:27:10.008
Careful, then. You might cut yourself.

546
01:27:15.450 --> 01:27:18.516
No more, shing... no more...

547
01:27:24.840 --> 01:27:26.466
Lian, no!!

548
01:28:07.145 --> 01:28:10.516
Lord shing is dead.

549
01:28:37.411 --> 01:28:40.506
- Sister!
- I'll be all right.

550
01:28:46.707 --> 01:28:51.512
- What were you thinking?
- Of my country...

551
01:28:53.169 --> 01:28:56.635
And qiang... I love you...

552
01:29:03.065 --> 01:29:05.065
I'm sorry.

553
01:29:14.430 --> 01:29:16.040
Your majesty.

554
01:29:25.866 --> 01:29:27.412
Please, forgive me.
